Package: lorgarctl
Version: @@VERSION@@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Matvei <w3ar3boys@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6, libudev1, libhidapi-hidraw0 | libhidapi-libusb0, libdbus-1-3, libglib2.0-0
Recommends: dkms
Description: CLI controller, user daemon and DKMS driver for LORGAR MSA10W
 Complete open-source Linux control stack for the LORGAR MSA10W wireless
 gaming mouse. Provides DPI switching, RGB controls, native battery
 integration via UPower / power_supply, background profile daemon,
 and optional hid-lorgar kernel driver.
Homepage: https://github.com/Sqrilizz/lorgarctl
